#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:45
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fungsi"

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:49
msgid "Initializes an onboard depth sensor."
msgstr "Menginisialisasi sensor kedalaman onboard."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:51
msgid "``type`` indicates the type of TOF sensor:"
msgstr "``type`` menunjukkan jenis sensor TOF:"

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:53
msgid "`tof.TOF_VL53LX`: 8x8 pixels."
msgstr "`tof.TOF_VL53LX`\\ : 8x8 piksel."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:55
msgid ""
"By default ``type`` is ``-1`` which causes `tof.init()` to automatically "
"scan and initialize an attached TOF sensor based on the I2C address."
msgstr ""
"Secara default ``type`` adalah ``-1`` yang menyebabkan `tof.init()` secara "
"otomatis memindai dan menginisialisasi sensor TOF yang terpasang berdasarkan"
" alamat I2C."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:60
msgid "Resets the depth sensor state."
msgstr "Mereset status sensor kedalaman."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:64
msgid "Deinitializes the depth sensor freeing up resources."
msgstr "Mendeiinisialisasi sensor kedalaman dan membebaskan sumber daya."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:68
msgid ""
"Returns the width (horizontal resolution) of the depth sensor in-use. Raises"
" a ``RuntimeError`` if the sensor is not initialized."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan lebar (resolusi horizontal) sensor kedalaman yang sedang "
"digunakan. Memunculkan ``RuntimeError`` jika sensor tidak diinisialisasi."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:73
msgid ""
"Returns the height (vertical resolution) of the depth sensor in-use. Raises "
"a ``RuntimeError`` if the sensor is not initialized."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan tinggi (resolusi vertikal) sensor kedalaman yang sedang "
"digunakan. Memunculkan ``RuntimeError`` jika sensor tidak diinisialisasi."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:78
msgid "Returns the type of the depth sensor in-use:"
msgstr "Mengembalikan jenis sensor kedalaman yang sedang digunakan:"

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:80
msgid "`tof.TOF_VL53LX`"
msgstr "`tof.TOF_VL53LX`"

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:82 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:90
msgid "Raises a ``RuntimeError`` if the sensor is not initialized."
msgstr "Memunculkan ``RuntimeError`` jika sensor tidak diinisialisasi."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:86
msgid "Returns the refresh rate (in Hz) of the depth sensor in-use:"
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan laju penyegaran (dalam Hz) sensor kedalaman yang sedang "
"digunakan:"

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:88
msgid "`tof.TOF_VL53LX`: 15 Hz."
msgstr "`tof.TOF_VL53LX`\\ : 15 Hz."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:94
msgid ""
"Returns a tuple containing the depth list (``width * height`` floats in mm),"
" the minimum depth seen, and the maximum depth seen."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan tuple yang berisi daftar kedalaman (\\ ``width * height`` "
"float dalam mm), kedalaman minimum yang terlihat, dan kedalaman maksimum "
"yang terlihat."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:97
msgid "``hmirror`` if ``True`` horizontally mirrors the depth array."
msgstr ""
"``hmirror`` jika ``True`` mencerminkan array kedalaman secara horizontal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:99
msgid "``vflip`` if ``True`` vertically flips the depth array."
msgstr "``vflip`` jika ``True`` membalik array kedalaman secara vertikal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:101
msgid "``transpose`` if ``True`` transposes the depth array."
msgstr "``transpose`` jika ``True`` melakukan transpose pada array kedalaman."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:103 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:224
msgid ""
"``timeout`` how many milliseconds to wait for the new frame before raising a"
" ``RuntimeError``. If ``0`` waits forever."
msgstr ""
"``timeout`` berapa milidetik untuk menunggu bingkai baru sebelum memunculkan"
" ``RuntimeError``\\ . Jika ``0`` menunggu selamanya."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:108
msgid ""
"Draws a ``depth`` array (as returned by `read_depth`) onto ``image`` whose "
"top-left corner starts at location ``x``, ``y``."
msgstr ""
"Menggambar array ``depth`` (seperti yang dikembalikan oleh `read_depth`\\ ) "
"ke ``image`` yang pojok kiri atasnya dimulai dari lokasi ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:111
msgid ""
"``x_scale`` controls how much the displayed image is scaled by in the x "
"direction (float). If this value is negative the image will be flipped "
"horizontally. If unspecified it matches ``y_scale`` to maintain aspect "
"ratio."
msgstr ""
"``x_scale`` mengontrol seberapa besar citra yang ditampilkan diskalakan "
"dalam arah x (float). Jika nilai ini negatif, citra akan dicerminkan secara "
"horizontal. Jika tidak ditentukan, nilainya mengikuti ``y_scale`` untuk "
"mempertahankan rasio aspek."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:115
msgid ""
"``y_scale`` controls how much the displayed image is scaled by in the y "
"direction (float). If this value is negative the image will be flipped "
"vertically. If unspecified it matches ``x_scale`` to maintain aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"``y_scale`` mengontrol seberapa besar citra yang ditampilkan diskalakan "
"dalam arah y (float). Jika nilai ini negatif, citra akan dibalik secara "
"vertikal. Jika tidak ditentukan, nilainya mengikuti ``x_scale`` untuk "
"mempertahankan rasio aspek."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:119
msgid ""
"``roi`` is the region-of-interest rectangle tuple ``(x, y, w, h)`` of the "
"source depth array to draw."
msgstr ""
"``roi`` adalah tuple persegi panjang wilayah yang diminati ``(x, y, w, h)`` "
"dari array kedalaman sumber yang akan digambar."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:122
msgid ""
"``rgb_channel`` is the RGB channel (0=R, 1=G, 2=B) to extract from the "
"source. ``-1`` (default) uses all channels."
msgstr ""
"``rgb_channel`` adalah kanal RGB (0=R, 1=G, 2=B) yang diekstrak dari sumber."
" ``-1`` (default) menggunakan semua kanal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:125
msgid ""
"``alpha`` controls how much of the source is blended into the destination "
"image. ``255`` is opaque, ``0`` results in no modification. Range: 0-255."
msgstr ""
"``alpha`` mengontrol seberapa banyak sumber yang dicampur ke citra tujuan. "
"``255`` adalah buram, ``0`` tidak menghasilkan modifikasi. Rentang: 0-255."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:128
msgid ""
"``color_palette`` is a color palette enum (e.g. `image.PALETTE_DEPTH`, "
"`image.PALETTE_RAINBOW`) or a 256-pixel RGB565 image used as a color lookup "
"table on the grayscale depth value."
msgstr ""
"``color_palette`` adalah enum palet warna (mis. `image.PALETTE_DEPTH`\\ , "
"`image.PALETTE_RAINBOW`\\ ) atau citra RGB565 256-piksel yang digunakan "
"sebagai tabel pencarian warna pada nilai kedalaman skala abu-abu."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:132
msgid ""
"``alpha_palette`` if not ``None`` is a 256-pixel GRAYSCALE image used as an "
"alpha lookup table modulating ``alpha`` per pixel."
msgstr ""
"``alpha_palette`` jika tidak ``None`` adalah citra GRAYSCALE 256-piksel yang"
" digunakan sebagai tabel pencarian alpha yang memodulasi ``alpha`` per "
"piksel."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:135 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:196
msgid "``hint`` is a logical OR of:"
msgstr "``hint`` adalah OR logis dari:"

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:137 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:198
msgid "`image.AREA`: Use area scaling when downscaling."
msgstr "`image.AREA`\\ : Gunakan penskalaan area saat memperkecil."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:138 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:199
msgid "`image.BILINEAR`: Use bilinear scaling."
msgstr "`image.BILINEAR`\\ : Gunakan penskalaan bilinear."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:139 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:200
msgid "`image.BICUBIC`: Use bicubic scaling."
msgstr "`image.BICUBIC`\\ : Gunakan penskalaan bikubik."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:140 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:201
msgid "`image.CENTER`: Center the image on the destination."
msgstr "`image.CENTER`\\ : Pusatkan citra pada tujuan."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:141 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:202
msgid "`image.HMIRROR`: Horizontally mirror."
msgstr "`image.HMIRROR`\\ : Cerminkan secara horizontal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:142 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:203
msgid "`image.VFLIP`: Vertically flip."
msgstr "`image.VFLIP`\\ : Balik secara vertikal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:143 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:204
msgid "`image.TRANSPOSE`: Transpose (swap x/y)."
msgstr "`image.TRANSPOSE`\\ : Transpose (tukar x/y)."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:144 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:205
msgid ""
"`image.EXTRACT_RGB_CHANNEL_FIRST`: Apply rgb_channel extraction before "
"scaling."
msgstr ""
"`image.EXTRACT_RGB_CHANNEL_FIRST`\\ : Terapkan ekstraksi rgb_channel sebelum"
" penskalaan."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:145 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:206
msgid "`image.APPLY_COLOR_PALETTE_FIRST`: Apply color palette before scaling."
msgstr ""
"`image.APPLY_COLOR_PALETTE_FIRST`\\ : Terapkan palet warna sebelum "
"penskalaan."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:146 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:207
msgid ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_KEEP`: Fit inside the destination keeping aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_KEEP`\\ : Sesuaikan di dalam tujuan dengan "
"mempertahankan rasio aspek."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:147 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:208
msgid ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_EXPAND`: Fill the destination keeping aspect ratio "
"(crops)."
msgstr ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_EXPAND`\\ : Isi tujuan dengan mempertahankan rasio aspek"
" (memotong)."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:148 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:209
msgid ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_IGNORE`: Fill the destination ignoring aspect ratio "
"(stretches)."
msgstr ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_IGNORE`\\ : Isi tujuan dengan mengabaikan rasio aspek "
"(meregangkan)."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:149 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:210
msgid "`image.ROTATE_90`: Rotate by 90 degrees."
msgstr "`image.ROTATE_90`\\ : Putar 90 derajat."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:150 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:211
msgid "`image.ROTATE_180`: Rotate by 180 degrees."
msgstr "`image.ROTATE_180`\\ : Putar 180 derajat."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:151 ../../library/omv.tof.rst:212
msgid "`image.ROTATE_270`: Rotate by 270 degrees."
msgstr "`image.ROTATE_270`\\ : Putar 270 derajat."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:153
msgid ""
"``scale`` is a two-value tuple ``(min, max)`` controlling the min and max "
"depth (in mm) used to scale the depth image. Defaults to the depth array's "
"actual min and max."
msgstr ""
"``scale`` adalah tuple dua nilai ``(min, max)`` yang mengontrol kedalaman "
"minimum dan maksimum (dalam mm) yang digunakan untuk menskalakan citra "
"kedalaman. Default ke nilai min dan maks aktual array kedalaman."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:159
msgid ""
"`read_depth` remembers if it was called with ``transpose=True`` and "
"``draw_depth`` uses that internally to size the source array."
msgstr ""
"`read_depth` mengingat apakah dipanggil dengan ``transpose=True`` dan "
"``draw_depth`` menggunakannya secara internal untuk menentukan ukuran array "
"sumber."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:164
msgid ""
"Reads a frame from the depth sensor and returns a new `image.Image` object "
"that is either `image.GRAYSCALE` or `image.RGB565`."
msgstr ""
"Membaca bingkai dari sensor kedalaman dan mengembalikan objek `image.Image` "
"baru yang berformat `image.GRAYSCALE` atau `image.RGB565`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:167
msgid "``hmirror`` if ``True`` horizontally mirrors the new image."
msgstr "``hmirror`` jika ``True`` mencerminkan citra baru secara horizontal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:169
msgid "``vflip`` if ``True`` vertically flips the new image."
msgstr "``vflip`` jika ``True`` membalik citra baru secara vertikal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:171
msgid "``transpose`` if ``True`` transposes the new image."
msgstr "``transpose`` jika ``True`` melakukan transpose pada citra baru."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:173
msgid ""
"``x_scale`` controls how much the image is scaled in the x direction "
"(float). Negative values flip horizontally. If unspecified it matches "
"``y_scale``."
msgstr ""
"``x_scale`` mengontrol seberapa besar citra diskalakan dalam arah x (float)."
" Nilai negatif membalik secara horizontal. Jika tidak ditentukan, nilainya "
"mengikuti ``y_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:177
msgid ""
"``y_scale`` controls how much the image is scaled in the y direction "
"(float). Negative values flip vertically. If unspecified it matches "
"``x_scale``."
msgstr ""
"``y_scale`` mengontrol seberapa besar citra diskalakan dalam arah y (float)."
" Nilai negatif membalik secara vertikal. Jika tidak ditentukan, nilainya "
"mengikuti ``x_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:181
msgid ""
"``roi`` is the region-of-interest rectangle tuple ``(x, y, w, h)`` of the "
"source to extract."
msgstr ""
"``roi`` adalah tuple persegi panjang wilayah yang diminati ``(x, y, w, h)`` "
"dari sumber yang akan diekstrak."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:184
msgid ""
"``rgb_channel`` is the RGB channel (0=R, 1=G, 2=B) to extract. ``-1`` "
"(default) uses all channels."
msgstr ""
"``rgb_channel`` adalah kanal RGB (0=R, 1=G, 2=B) yang diekstrak. ``-1`` "
"(default) menggunakan semua kanal."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:187
msgid ""
"``alpha`` controls source-to-destination blending. ``255`` is opaque, ``0`` "
"leaves the destination unchanged. Range: 0-255."
msgstr ""
"``alpha`` mengontrol pencampuran sumber-ke-tujuan. ``255`` adalah buram, "
"``0`` membiarkan tujuan tidak berubah. Rentang: 0-255."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:190
msgid ""
"``color_palette`` is a color palette enum (e.g. `image.PALETTE_DEPTH`) or a "
"256-pixel RGB565 image used as a color lookup table."
msgstr ""
"``color_palette`` adalah enum palet warna (mis. `image.PALETTE_DEPTH`\\ ) "
"atau citra RGB565 256-piksel yang digunakan sebagai tabel pencarian warna."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:193
msgid ""
"``alpha_palette`` if not ``None`` is a 256-pixel GRAYSCALE image used as an "
"alpha lookup table."
msgstr ""
"``alpha_palette`` jika tidak ``None`` adalah citra GRAYSCALE 256-piksel yang"
" digunakan sebagai tabel pencarian alpha."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:214
msgid ""
"``scale`` is a two-value tuple ``(min, max)`` controlling the min and max "
"depth (in mm) used to scale the image. Defaults to the frame's actual "
"min/max."
msgstr ""
"``scale`` adalah tuple dua nilai ``(min, max)`` yang mengontrol kedalaman "
"minimum dan maksimum (dalam mm) yang digunakan untuk menskalakan citra. "
"Default ke nilai min/maks aktual bingkai."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:218
msgid ""
"``pixformat`` controls the final image pixel format. Must be "
"`image.GRAYSCALE` or `image.RGB565`."
msgstr ""
"``pixformat`` mengontrol format piksel citra akhir. Harus berupa "
"`image.GRAYSCALE` atau `image.RGB565`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:221
msgid ""
"``copy_to_fb`` if ``True`` writes the new image into the frame buffer "
"instead of allocating it on the MicroPython heap."
msgstr ""
"``copy_to_fb`` jika ``True`` menulis citra baru ke dalam buffer bingkai "
"alih-alih mengalokasikannya di heap MicroPython."

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:228
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstanta"

#: ../../library/omv.tof.rst:233
msgid "VL53L5CX or VL53L8CX TOF sensor (8x8 pixels)."
msgstr "Sensor TOF VL53L5CX atau VL53L8CX (8x8 piksel)."
